	(text "REV A: WHOLE SHEET DNP (K-16), footprints kept. TP6 (SD_3V3) pad on prog/TP sheet stays FIT.\\nRules (05 §5): FW sets VO4 = 3.3 V (on-chip LDO 4) BEFORE SD_EN; data pull-ups on switched SD_3V3 only; CD pull-up on main 3V3; FW tri-states SD pins before SD_EN off.\\nsdkconfig: override IDF default SD power-reset GPIO45 -> SD_EN = GPIO29. TODO: SD line ESD <=3.5 pF (E-30) not drawn."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 140 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "09fe75b7-e93a-4e30-a6be-36542f5cccc3")
	)
